    "originalNotes": "1.2 Learnability (AF)\nThe product is straightforward to learn how to use, with an intuitive onboarding experience.\nLook fors: (a) When an adult user onboards into the product, minimal time and effort is required to start using basic functionality.; (b) tool tips or guided tutorials are provided in context for first time use of new features and complex workflows.\n\n\n",
