    "originalText": "1.2 Learnability\nThe platform provides a straightforward onboarding experience that allows adult users to begin using core functionality with minimal time and effort. When a user is added to the platform, they receive a welcome email with simple instructions for setting up their account. Users can further streamline the process by signing in through their district’s SSO provider, such as Clever or ClassLink, or through an LMS such as Canvas, Blackboard, or Brightspace D2L and instantly access platform features. \nUpon their first login, users receive a brief welcome pop-up introducing them to the platform. After approximately one minute, users can immediately browse the video library, allowing them to begin using the platform’s core functionality without requiring extensive setup or training.\nOne link in the welcome email allows users to quickly set their password, while a second link provides direct access to the platform login. The email also includes a link to contact the support team, ensuring that users can easily get assistance if they encounter any issues during setup.",
    "revisedText": "1.2 Learnability\n\nThe platform provides a straightforward onboarding experience that allows adult users to begin using core functionality with minimal time and effort. When a user is added to the platform, they receive a welcome email with simple instructions for setting up their account. Users can further streamline the process by signing in through their district’s SSO provider, such as Clever or ClassLink, or through an LMS such as Canvas, Blackboard, or Brightspace D2L and instantly access platform features. \nUpon their first login, users receive a brief welcome pop-up introducing them to the platform. After approximately one minute, users can immediately browse the video library, allowing them to begin using the platform’s core functionality without requiring extensive setup or training.\n\n\nOne link in the welcome email allows users to quickly set their password, while a second link provides direct access to the platform login. The email also includes a link to contact the support team, ensuring that users can easily get assistance if they encounter any issues during setup.",
