    "originalText": "1.5 Interface Design\nThe platform’s interface organizes buttons, links, and content in a clear and consistent way, with frequently used features and important content prominently displayed. The homepage puts video content front and center, while the top navigation provides quick access to commonly used features such as playlists and favorites. Additional features are organized within the waffle menu, keeping less frequently used options accessible without creating visual clutter. Consistent navigation, recognizable icons, and multiple access points for frequently used features make the overall experience intuitive and efficient.",
    "revisedText": "1.5 Interface Design\nThe platform’s interface organizes buttons, links, and content in a clear and consistent way, with frequently used features and important content prominently displayed. The homepage puts video content front and center, while the top navigation provides quick access to commonly used features such as playlists and favorites. Additional features are organized within the waffle menu, keeping less frequently used options accessible without creating visual clutter. Consistent navigation, recognizable icons, and multiple access points for frequently used features make the overall experience intuitive and efficient.\n",
