    "originalText": "1.11 Data Privacy\nTeaching Channel clearly communicates its commitment to protecting user data through a dedicated, easy-to-find Privacy Policy on its website. The policy explains what information is collected, how it is used and shared, how long it is retained, and the safeguards used to protect it, including SSL encryption and administrative, physical, and technical security measures. Teaching Channel also states that it does not sell personal information and does not collect student personal information from records maintained by educational institutions through its services. The policy outlines compliance with privacy requirements including COPPA, CCPA, and GDPR, giving educators and institutions clear information about their privacy rights and Teaching Channel’s data practices.\nFirst-time users are prompted to review the platform’s Privacy Policy upon login.",
    "revisedText": "1.11 Data Privacy\nTeaching Channel clearly communicates its commitment to protecting user data through a dedicated, easy-to-find Privacy Policy on its website. The policy explains what information is collected, how it is used and shared, how long it is retained, and the safeguards used to protect it, including SSL encryption and administrative, physical, and technical security measures. Teaching Channel also states that it does not sell personal information. The policy outlines compliance with privacy requirements including COPPA, CCPA, and GDPR, giving educators and institutions clear information about their privacy rights and Teaching Channel’s data practices.\n\n\n\nFirst-time users are prompted to review the platform’s Privacy Policy upon login.",
