    "originalNotes": "3.5 Collaborative Interaction (AF)\nThe product features functionality to support collaboration among educators and between educators and facilitators. Look fors: (a) Ability for educators to provide feedback and solicit facilitator or coach response at specific spots in educators’ work; (b) ability for educators to provide feedback on peers’ work; (c) immediate (real-time) collaboration that supports online group work; (d) straightforward ability to share a product with others and add new collaborators.\n\n",
    "revisedNotes": "3.5 Collaborative Interaction (AF)\nThe product features functionality to support collaboration among educators and between educators and facilitators. Look fors: (a) Ability for educators to provide feedback and solicit facilitator or coach response at specific spots in educators’ work; (b) ability for educators to provide feedback on peers’ work; (c) immediate (real-time) collaboration that supports online group work; (d) straightforward ability to share a product with others and add new collaborators.\n\n",
    "originalText": "3.5 Collaborative Interaction\nThe platform supports collaboration by allowing educators to use platform video content or upload their own video to receive and provide immediate feedback. Users can leave time-stamped feedback at specific points in a video, guided by a rubric, and engage in discussion with facilitators, coaches, or peers. This makes it easy to share work and collaborate around specific content or moments.\nOPTIONAL\nUsers can use the Share workflow to easily share content (Teaching Channel videos or their own) with a coach or colleague. ",
    "revisedText": "3.5 Collaborative Interaction\nThe platform supports collaboration by allowing educators to use platform video content or upload their own video to receive and provide immediate feedback. Users can leave time-stamped feedback at specific points in a video, guided by a rubric, and engage in discussion with facilitators, coaches, or peers. This makes it easy to share work and collaborate around specific content or moments.\nOPTIONAL\nUsers can use the Share workflow to easily share content (Teaching Channel videos or their own) with a coach or colleague. \n",
