    "revisedText": "4.1 Diverse Representation\n\nThe video library features diverse educators and students across a wide range of classrooms, schools, and communities. Videos are filmed nationwide in settings ranging from small charter schools to large districts and include representation of varied racial, ethnic, cultural, and socioeconomic backgrounds. The library also includes content featuring English language learners and students receiving special education services, as well as educators ranging from first-year teachers to experienced veterans.\nThought Starters that encourage conversation and reflection about the video content ",
