    "revisedNotes": "2.2 Leader Educators seek opportunities for leadership to support student empowerment and success and to improve teaching and learning. (AF)\n2.2.a Educators shape, advance and accelerate a shared vision for empowered learning with technology by engaging with education stakeholders.\nLink to 2.2.a video ",
    "originalText": "2.2.a Leader: Advance a Shared Vision \nDistrict and building leaders can adopt the platform to establish a shared vision for improving teacher practice and student outcomes through technology. Leadership communicates clear goals for using the platform, encouraging teachers and coaches to incorporate technology into their practice, which can extend to how students use technology for learning. The platform also encourages educators to record and share their teaching, creating opportunities for colleagues, coaches, and other stakeholders to learn from one another and collaboratively improve practice. This shared approach helps educators become active participants in advancing technology-supported learning across their school or district.",
    "revisedText": "2.2.a Leader: Advance a Shared Vision \nDistrict and building leaders can adopt the platform to establish a shared vision for improving teacher practice and student outcomes through technology. Leadership communicates clear goals for using the platform, encouraging teachers and coaches to incorporate technology into their practice, which can extend to how students use technology for learning. The platform also encourages educators to record and share their teaching, creating opportunities for colleagues, coaches, and other stakeholders to learn from one another and collaboratively improve practice. This shared approach helps educators become active participants in advancing technology-supported learning across their school or district.",
